  "en": "ICRH against METIS: the resonance layer to 1.9 %, the four minority ingredients within 7.8 %, steady-row electron power 0.955–1.079 and fast-ion energy 0.948–1.014, the profile peak within 0.05; FWCD against the measurements, median 0.979"
